{"kind": "chat_performance", "workload": "chinese", "repeat": 1, "prompt": "请详细说明分布式任务队列如何处理任务重试、幂等、超时和工作节点故障，并给出一个具体例子。", "input_ids": [248045, 846, 198, 96220, 128110, 112149, 97995, 113165, 126829, 97995, 145748, 5205, 103557, 96024, 5205, 132980, 110671, 101971, 101775, 3709, 96172, 110334, 96125, 97990, 102177, 1710, 248046, 198, 248045, 74455, 198, 248068, 271, 248069, 271], "prompt_tokens": 35, "output_tokens": 256, "answer": "# 分布式任务队列：重试、幂等、超时与故障处理详解\n\n## 一、整体架构概览\n\n```\n┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐\n│  Producer   │────▶│  Message Broker  │────▶│  Worker Pool    │\n│ (任务生产者) │     │  (RabbitMQ/Redis │     │ (工作节点集群)   │\n└─────────────┘     │   /Kafka等)      │     └────────┬────────┘\n                    └──────────────────┘              │\n                                                      ▼\n                                              ┌───────────────┐\n                                              │  Result Store │\n                                              │  (DB/Redis)   │\n                                              └───────────────┘\n```\n\n核心挑战：**分布式环境下，网络分区、节点崩溃、消息重复投递是常态而非异常**。\n\n---\n\n## 二、四大核心机制详解\n\n### 1. 任务重试（Retry）\n\n#### 为什么需要重试？\n- 瞬时故障：网络抖动、数据库连接池耗尽、第三方API限流\n- 永久性故障：代码bug", "input_sha256": "7d6c91f3356f57478fac3800d43abad2970bf52f3985e8e9b3733fc8606b5ada", "output_sha256": "1605bc161875a9622b05750fb020ca3f2250cb6e8228b7bf7ccf52e05cdd601f", "ttft_seconds": 1.1004684939980507, "elapsed_seconds": 14.707209877669811, "timings": {"cache_n": 0, "prompt_n": 35, "prompt_ms": 1046.6, "prompt_per_token_ms": 29.903, "prompt_per_second": 33.4, "predicted_n": 256, "predicted_ms": 13658.5, "predicted_per_token_ms": 53.354, "predicted_per_second": 18.7, "draft_n": 0, "draft_n_accepted": 0}, "engine": {"generated": 256, "prompt_tokens": 35, "prompt_ms": 1046.6, "decode_ms": 13658.5, "finish": "length", "drafts_accepted": 0, "drafts_offered": 0, "reused": 0, "hits": 115231, "lookups": 122880, "ram_blobs